---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Agent Merge">
  <h1>Agent Merge</h1>
  <p>
    An agent that fixes review findings and then merges a change is a separate capability from
    GitHub's ordinary auto-merge. Agent Merge has not been verified in this rehearsal.
    No workflow here impersonates an agent or automatically implements review fixes.
  </p>
  <p>
    The repository setting <code>allow_auto_merge</code> only allows eligible pull requests to use
    ordinary auto-merge after requirements are met. It does not enable Agent Merge, resolve
    review findings, or prove who made a fix. Dependabot updates still need review and tests.
  </p>
  <div class="card">
    For this safe rehearsal, show the proposed diff and passing checks, then use a manual merge
    only after explicit approval. Do not describe that as an automated or agent-performed merge.
  </div>
</Layout>
